WEBVTT

1
00:54:00.130 --> 00:54:04.130
I want to speak a few encouraging words about us as a church.

2
00:54:04.130 --> 00:54:13.130
I think we, as a church, need to be encouraged by the words that Jesus speaks about us.

3
00:54:13.130 --> 00:54:18.130
And you are now sitting down, but soon you will stand up.

4
00:54:18.130 --> 00:54:21.130
For these are indeed the words of the Lord Himself.

5
00:54:21.130 --> 00:54:27.130
Frans, you are still standing, right Frans? Tap him on the shoulder, Frans.

6
00:54:27.130 --> 00:54:33.130
Listen, what I am about to say are the words of Jesus that He spoke over us 2000 years ago.

7
00:54:33.130 --> 00:54:36.130
And these may seem like very heavy words from the Lord.

8
00:54:36.130 --> 00:54:43.130
But you all must understand that the Lord always prepares encouragement and life for us. Amen.

9
00:54:43.130 --> 00:54:45.130
These are the words.

10
00:54:45.130 --> 00:54:48.130
Michel, you don't need to follow them on the screen.

11
00:54:48.130 --> 00:54:55.130
Listen carefully to my words, for I am taking them from Luke chapter 21.

12
00:54:55.130 --> 00:54:59.130
And I am doing a fragment here from a fragment of that, but follow my words.

13
00:54:59.130 --> 00:55:08.130
Jesus said, be careful that you are not deceived by anyone, for many will claim that they are mine.

14
00:55:08.130 --> 00:55:16.130
They will say, I am He, and the time is near. Do not believe them.

15
00:55:16.130 --> 00:55:20.130
You will also hear about wars and unrest.

16
00:55:20.130 --> 00:55:22.130
Do not be alarmed about that.

17
00:55:22.130 --> 00:55:27.130
These things must happen first, for that is not yet the end.

18
00:55:27.130 --> 00:55:31.130
I repeat, that is not yet the end.

19
00:55:31.130 --> 00:55:36.130
Then He said to them, nations and kingdoms will wage war against each other.

20
00:55:36.130 --> 00:55:39.130
There will be severe earthquakes in various places.

21
00:55:39.130 --> 00:55:44.130
There will be dangerous diseases and famines here and there.

22
00:55:44.130 --> 00:55:47.130
There will also be terrible things to see in the sky.

23
00:55:47.130 --> 00:55:48.130
Then I will go a little further.

24
00:55:48.130 --> 00:55:52.130
And there will be strange things to see in the sun, the moon, and the stars.

25
00:55:52.130 --> 00:55:56.130
The nations will be in despair from fear because of the roaring of the sea.

26
00:55:56.130 --> 00:56:05.130
People will be terrified by the things happening in the world, for the powers of the spiritual world will be shaken.

27
00:56:05.130 --> 00:56:13.130
And then people will see the Son of Man coming in His radiant heavenly power and majesty in the clouds.

28
00:56:17.130 --> 00:56:27.130
When these things begin to happen, and here He comes, stand up straight and lift up your heads, for your redemption is drawing near.

29
00:56:27.130 --> 00:56:33.130
When all these things happen, stand up straight and lift up your heads.

30
00:56:33.130 --> 00:56:37.130
Can I encourage us with the words of the Lord?

31
00:56:38.130 --> 00:56:50.130
When all these things happen, Jesus says, do not be bent down by fear, do not be bent down by self-pity, do not be bent down by all the difficulties you see happening around you.

32
00:56:50.130 --> 00:57:02.130
When all these things happen, Jesus says, do not be bent down by fear, do not be bent down by self-pity, do not be bent down by all the difficulties you see happening around you.

33
00:57:02.130 --> 00:57:07.130
And you know what? The world is in pain, and not just in 2021.

34
00:57:07.130 --> 00:57:18.130
In 1500 AD the world was in pain, in 500 AD the world was in a whole lot of pain, in 2200 AD the world will still be in a lot of pain.

35
00:57:18.130 --> 00:57:28.130
But Jesus says here, when you see wars happening, earthquakes happening, diseases raging around you, what do we do as Christians?

36
00:57:28.130 --> 00:57:33.130
Then we say God of Revival, God of Revival.

37
00:57:33.130 --> 00:57:44.130
This is the moment for Christians to stand up, lift their heads, and say, I know what's happening, I know that all this is happening.

38
00:57:44.130 --> 00:57:51.130
But I will never bow to this world, my head will be lifted to the Most High.

39
00:57:51.130 --> 00:57:58.130
Do you get it? Shall we pray? Shall we pray for this church, but shall we also pray for the global church?

40
00:57:58.130 --> 00:58:04.130
Shall we pray for our brothers and sisters in other countries where the name of Jesus may no longer be spoken?

41
00:58:04.130 --> 00:58:13.130
You know, in Luke chapter 21 there are also things about how ultimately there will be people who are dragged before the court because they speak the name of Jesus.

42
00:58:13.130 --> 00:58:16.130
Do you know that we still live in a very fine country?

43
00:58:16.130 --> 00:58:22.130
Did you know that Belgium and the Netherlands are still not, still not hostile towards the name of Jesus?

44
00:58:22.130 --> 00:58:28.130
Here and there you see things emerging, but it is nothing compared to China, it is nothing compared to Iran.

45
00:58:28.130 --> 00:58:35.130
It is nothing compared to other countries where you cannot even freely speak the name of Jesus or they drag you before the court.

46
00:58:35.130 --> 00:58:40.130
And when Jesus says these things, you think, Jesus, you are not a prophet of doom, are you?

47
00:58:40.130 --> 00:58:44.130
No, Jesus is Lord over everything that is going to happen.

48
00:58:44.130 --> 00:58:55.130
And that is why He says, because I am the Lord over everything that is going to happen, you can see it happen as a Christian, but know who the Lord is above these things.

49
00:58:56.130 --> 00:59:01.130
And you know, I just want to pray for our church.

50
00:59:01.130 --> 00:59:12.130
I want to pray for our church, that this church and the church of Jesus Christ, wherever it may be, in the Kempen, in North Brabant, in Limburg, in Belgium, in the Netherlands, in the whole world.

51
00:59:12.130 --> 00:59:22.130
I just want to pray for the brothers and sisters in the name of Jesus, that we will not be burdened by the things that the world imposes on people.

52
00:59:22.130 --> 00:59:24.130
For who is our Lord?

53
00:59:24.130 --> 00:59:26.130
Who is our Lord?

54
00:59:26.130 --> 00:59:29.130
Is a whisper of wars our Lord?

55
00:59:29.130 --> 00:59:31.130
Is a disease our Lord?

56
00:59:31.130 --> 00:59:38.130
