57
00:59:38.130 --> 00:59:41.130
Or do I fill myself with the Word of God?

58
00:59:41.130 --> 00:59:46.130
And do I say, when I see these things happen, I will stand and keep my head up.

59
00:59:46.130 --> 00:59:47.130
Hallelujah.

60
00:59:47.130 --> 00:59:52.130
Jesus, shall we pray together? Shall we pray together? Shall we close our eyes or maybe you can raise your hands?

61
00:59:52.130 --> 00:59:56.130
But shall we pray for this church and shall we pray for the church of Jesus?

62
00:59:56.130 --> 01:00:08.130
Lord, I pray in Jesus' name that this church, the church of Jesus Christ, worldwide, that we will call upon the name of Jesus when we see things happening in our lives that just don't add up.

63
01:00:08.130 --> 01:00:13.130
