64
01:00:13.130 --> 01:00:16.130
That there will be power and authority coming from us.

65
01:00:16.130 --> 01:00:21.130
That we will know where to find hope. That we will know where to find peace.

66
01:00:21.130 --> 01:00:24.130
That we will know where to find protection.

67
01:00:24.130 --> 01:00:30.130
But that they will know that He who is in us is greater than he who is in the world.

68
01:00:30.130 --> 01:00:35.130
I repeat, He who is in us is greater than he who is in the world.

69
01:00:35.130 --> 01:00:39.130
And we all proclaim the name of Jesus.

70
01:00:39.130 --> 01:00:44.130
Hallelujah. Hallelujah. The name of Jesus.

71
01:00:45.130 --> 01:00:47.130
The name of Jesus.

72
01:00:49.130 --> 01:00:57.130
